{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 341, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aa81432f2ff484fac0f1bdf25ef0b2f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "아이리스，//힘든 싸움이지만…//괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリス、//つらい戦いだけど……//大丈夫？", "pointer_offset": 292, "unit": "dialogue:d359c37b7103f9d3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 384, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0affb74f273f274f0af81b82f2ff0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff14ef97bf16bf559f0f08144", "baseline_text": "아직 괜찮아∈//하지만…//조금 무섭네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まだまだオッケーだよ！//でも……//ちょっとだけこわいね。", "pointer_offset": 296, "unit": "dialogue:02fd343f65246f22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 441, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f14ff98cf19cf0fa81b82f2ff0cff2c3f0b98143f99cf0adf1cdf0c82f2ff1acf9befa85f2aff0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "아이리스，기운 내자∈//다음에，내 마술을//보여 줄 테니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリス、元気だそうよ！//今度、ボクのマジック、//見せてあげるからさ！", "pointer_offset": 300, "unit": "dialogue:b4222174be48f7f9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 512, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f1adf1d7816081b82f2ff1acf984f2bff15a8143f1acf984f2bff15a81b82f2ff15afb6ff0adf1cdf8b2f154f15a8148", "baseline_text": "우와～∈//보고 싶어，보고 싶어∈//어떤 마술이 있어？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うわ～！//みたいみた～い！//どんなマジックがあるの？", "pointer_offset": 304, "unit": "dialogue:ecb2afb81a075c44", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 565, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0ebf1b1f8c8f0b2f1a0f9a9f1c8f0b181432f2ff0d3f8c1f4bef965f0adf1cdf0b2f0a8f2c0f14481432f2ff1bef8c7f144f8a4f154f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "동물을 이용한 거나，//인간 절단 마술이라든가，//여러 가지 있어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "動物を使うものとか、//人間切断マジックとか、//いろいろあるよ！", "pointer_offset": 308, "unit": "dialogue:06d781b77fcdbe05", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 628, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0a6f24df8f3f263f0b2f1488143f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf0f42f2ff1bef8c7f144f8a4f0adf1cdf0c82f2ffa57f94af154f0a4f1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "사실은 말이야，아이리스도//여러 가지 마술을//할 수 있지만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "実はね、アイリスも//いろいろなマジックが//できるんだけど……", "pointer_offset": 312, "unit": "dialogue:483eeb3a14ebb856", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 689, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0b9f372f372f7d12f2ff0c2f1e8f36df0b2f0b8f26181432f2ff14ef97bf0c9f4b9f0b2f0a48148", "baseline_text": "에헤헤…//초능력이니까，//조금 반칙이지？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エヘヘ……//ちょうのうりょくだから、//ちょっとハンソクだよね。", "pointer_offset": 316, "unit": "dialogue:be74dfbd2af4ec8e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 752, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143f99cf0adf1cdf0c32f2ff14ef0d7f0a5f1c78143f46ef951f16bf0e2f0e72f2ff1d4f9daf94af154f8a4f287f0c8f26181ac", "baseline_text": "하지만，내 마술과//조합하면，멋진 무대를//만들 수 있지 않을까〓", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、ボクのマジックと//組みあわせれば、すごい舞台が//できるんじゃない〓", "pointer_offset": 320, "unit": "dialogue:26b1e2fb074cff3a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 825, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f1e1f0af81b82f2ff0bef0a7f0aef0be8143f16ff8b2f94bf1acf0fa81b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf8f4f36bf36cf8b6fa57f2aff0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "맞아∈//코쿠리코，같이 해 보자∈//아이리스도 열심히 할 테니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうだね！//コクリコ、やってみようよ∈//アイリスもがんばるから！", "pointer_offset": 324, "unit": "dialogue:7c89ab98ed0e3758", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 890, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f0abf0baf0a6f8e1f0ecf0f32f2ff28dfb68f14bf1d9f1adf1842f2ff1bcf0b2f947f181f0cef0a5f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，미카사의 적은//얼른 해치우고//둘이서 연습하자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ、ミカサの敵は//さっさとかたづけて//二人でおけいこしようね∈", "pointer_offset": 328, "unit": "dialogue:62c05103c4b415a7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 955, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f0c1f0cf816081b82f2ff0b9f8b2f0b9f0b28143f0b5817c81b8", "baseline_text": "응，간다～∈//에이 에이，오－∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、いっくぞ～∈//えいえい、おー！", "pointer_offset": 332, "unit": "dialogue:ae96805f72a75e31", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04029.SBN", "offset": 992, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 336, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
